  "notes": [
    "EBIT definition used for historical is an operating proxy constructed as: Total Revenues minus (Cost of products sold + Selling, general and administrative + Research and development + Acquired IPRD + Amortization of acquired intangible assets). This excludes Other (income)/expense, net and income taxes; this is a modeling choice because the 10-K does not present a single 'Operating income' line item in the same way for direct EBIT extraction.",
    "D&A equals 'Depreciation and amortization, net' from the cash flow statement; capex equals 'Capital expenditures' from the cash flow statement. All are converted from the filing\u2019s 'dollars in millions' presentation to full USD units.",
    "NWC construction: (Receivables + Inventories + Other current assets) minus (Accounts payable + Other current liabilities) with cash and marketable debt securities (current) excluded from operating current assets and short-term debt obligations excluded from operating current liabilities. Negative NWC in 2024\u20132025 is permitted.",
    "Tax rate is set to 0.18 based on 2026 guidance effective tax rate (~18%) and applied to EBIT in the DCF even though guidance is presented on a non-GAAP framework.",
    "WACC (0.085) and terminal assumptions (terminal growth 0.02, exit EBITDA multiple 12.0, terminal method 'average') are base-case modeling inputs and are not directly disclosed as a single company-provided parameter.",
    "Forecast drivers for 2027\u20132030 are not explicitly guided in the captured materials; they are sober normalization assumptions based on the 2026 guided transition (Legacy pressure offset by Growth Portfolio) and gradual improvement in operating margin.",
    "NOL balance uses the disclosed U.S. federal net operating loss carryforwards ($1.3B) at December 31, 2025; NOL utilization percent is assumed at 0.80 because detailed utilization planning is not provided in the captured excerpts.",
    "Investments and minority interest (as balance-sheet valuation add-backs/deductions) are set to null due to incomplete balance-sheet breakdown extraction within the available captured sources."
